---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---
<Base title="About" description="ThaliMeter makes free, simple kitchen calculators so that you cook the right amount of food.">
  <section class="hero"><h1>About ThaliMeter</h1></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>ThaliMeter makes small, free kitchen calculators. Each one answers one question well: how much rice, pasta or meat to cook for the people at your table.</p>
    <p>We started it after one too many family dinners with a pot of rice that was half the size it needed to be, and then a party with enough leftovers for a week.</p>
    <p>The tools work on your device. You do not need an account, and we do not save what you type. See <a href="/how-we-calculate/">how we calculate</a> for every number we use.</p>
    <p>ThaliMeter is operated by {site.operator}. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
